{"seq":1,"slug":"organism-and-environment","title":"生物与环境：适应与耐受","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/individual-and-population-ecology/organism-and-environment","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物与环境-适应与耐受\">生物与环境：适应与耐受</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>把一株仙人掌挪到东北的雪地里，它活不过一个冬天；把一棵东北的红松搬到沙漠，它也撑不久。每种生物都只能在一定范围的环境条件里生存——这个看似平常的事实，是整个生态学的起点。本节要讲清三件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>环境因子</strong>：影响生物的外部条件，分为非生物因子（温度、水分、光照、土壤等）和生物因子（同种和异种生物）。</li>\n<li><strong>耐受性定律</strong>：每种生物对每个环境因子都有一个能忍受的范围，超出上限或下限都活不了。</li>\n<li><strong>适应</strong>：生物通过形态、生理、行为上的特征，让自己更好地匹配所处环境。</li>\n<li><strong>限制因子</strong>：在所有因子中，最接近生物耐受极限的那个，往往决定了生物能否在此生存。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这一节，你就能回答一个最基础的生态学问题：为什么某个物种出现在这里，而不出现在那里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"耐受范围与最适区\">耐受范围与最适区</h3><p>谢尔福德耐受性定律（Shelford&#39;s Law of Tolerance）说：生物的存在与繁盛，取决于环境因子是否落在它的耐受范围内。以温度为例，每种生物都有一个耐受下限、一个耐受上限，中间是它生长最好的&quot;最适区&quot;。靠近两端时，生物虽能勉强存活，但繁殖、生长都会受抑制。</p>\n<p>我们可以用一条钟形曲线来描述生物表现随某个因子的变化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[耐受下限] --&gt; B[亚适区]&#10;    B --&gt; C[最适区]&#10;    C --&gt; D[亚适区]&#10;    D --&gt; E[耐受上限]\">graph LR\n    A[耐受下限] --&gt; B[亚适区]\n    B --&gt; C[最适区]\n    C --&gt; D[亚适区]\n    D --&gt; E[耐受上限]</pre><p>在最适区，种群兴旺；越往两端走，个体越少，最终在耐受极限之外消失。这条曲线对温度成立，对盐度、pH、湿度同样成立。</p>\n<h3 id=\"限制因子与李比希最小因子定律\">限制因子与李比希最小因子定律</h3><p>一个生物同时受很多因子影响，但通常是其中&quot;最缺&quot;或&quot;最极端&quot;的那个卡住它。李比希最小因子定律（Liebig&#39;s Law of the Minimum）最早来自农业：作物产量不由养分总量决定，而由供应最不足的那种养分决定。比如土壤里氮磷都充足，唯独缺钾，那么补再多氮磷也没用，钾就是限制因子。</p>\n<p>这个思想推广到一般生态学：判断一个物种能否在某地生存，先找出最接近其耐受极限的那个因子。沙漠植物的限制因子通常是水，极地植物则是温度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三类适应\">三类适应</h3><p>生物应对环境约束的手段大致分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适应类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>形态适应</td>\n<td>身体结构上的特征</td>\n<td>仙人掌叶退化成刺以减少蒸腾；北极狐耳小以保温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生理适应</td>\n<td>体内机能的调节</td>\n<td>骆驼能让体温在白天升高以减少出汗；鱼类调节体内渗透压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为适应</td>\n<td>通过行动规避不利条件</td>\n<td>沙漠动物昼伏夜出；候鸟迁徙避寒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三类适应常常同时存在。骆驼既有形态适应（驼峰储脂、宽大脚掌），又有生理适应（耐脱水），共同造就了它的沙漠生存能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内稳态-主动调节-vs-被动顺应\">内稳态：主动调节 vs 被动顺应</h3><p>面对波动的环境，生物有两种策略。<strong>调节者</strong>（regulator）主动维持体内环境稳定，比如恒温动物把体温稳在某个值，代价是消耗大量能量。<strong>顺应者</strong>（conformer）则让体内随外界变化，比如多数鱼类体温随水温浮动，省了能量但活动范围受限。</p>\n<p>可以用一个简单关系理解维持内稳态的能量代价。设环境温度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，体温为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，恒温动物的产热率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 大致与内外温差成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = k \\cdot (T_b - T_e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是与体表散热有关的系数。环境越冷（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越低），温差越大，需要的产热越多——这解释了为什么寒带恒温动物要么体型大（相对散热面积小），要么有厚毛皮来降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一种鱼的温度耐受范围是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\,^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\,^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，最适温度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22\\,^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。如果某湖泊夏季水温常达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32\\,^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，请预测这种鱼在该湖的命运，并说明温度此时是不是限制因子。</li>\n<li>用李比希最小因子定律解释：为什么给一片同时缺氮和缺水的草地只浇水，产草量提升有限？</li>\n<li>列举你身边一种动物或植物，分别指出它的一项形态适应、一项生理适应（或行为适应）。</li>\n<li>恒温动物在寒冷环境中维持体温要耗费大量能量，为什么自然界还是演化出了大量恒温动物？它们换来了什么好处？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>想直观感受耐受范围，可以观察家里养的绿植：把一盆喜阴植物放到强光下，几天内叶片就会发黄甚至灼伤，这就是越过光照耐受上限的真实表现。</li>\n<li>关注一下你所在城市的&quot;物候&quot;现象——樱花什么时候开、燕子什么时候来。这些时间近年来普遍提前，正是生物对气候变暖这一环境因子改变做出的响应。</li>\n<li>推荐阅读普通生态学教材中&quot;生物与环境&quot;开篇章节，配合查阅&quot;贝格曼法则&quot;和&quot;阿伦法则&quot;，进一步理解体型与气候的关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们建立了生态学最底层的视角：生物始终被环境因子约束，每个因子都有耐受范围，而最接近极限的限制因子决定生死。生物通过形态、生理、行为三类适应来扩大生存空间，并通过调节或顺应两种策略应对环境波动。</p>\n<p>记住这条主线——&quot;约束在前，适应在后&quot;。它会贯穿后面所有章节：种群的增长受环境承载力约束，群落的分布受气候约束，生态系统的生产力受能量和养分约束。下一节我们把视角从个体放大到种群，看一群生物的数量是按什么规律变化的。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物与环境：适应与耐受","id":"生物与环境-适应与耐受"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"耐受范围与最适区","id":"耐受范围与最适区"},{"level":3,"text":"限制因子与李比希最小因子定律","id":"限制因子与李比希最小因子定律"},{"level":3,"text":"三类适应","id":"三类适应"},{"level":3,"text":"内稳态：主动调节 vs 被动顺应","id":"内稳态-主动调节-vs-被动顺应"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"种群增长模型：从指数到逻辑斯谛","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/ecology/individual-and-population-ecology/population-growth-models"}}